1
00:00:00,252 --> 00:00:02,382
(Sheldon:)Oh, come on, I'm practically
feeding you the answer.

2
00:00:02,388 --> 00:00:05,118
(Sheldon:)I compromise.

3
00:00:07,593 --> 00:00:11,063
(Raj:)Hey, uh, thanks for
keeping me company.
I'm happy to.

4
00:00:11,063 --> 00:00:13,393
(Howard:)I think getting out of
the apartment will do you good.

5
00:00:13,399 --> 00:00:16,229
(Howard:)So... where we headed?

6
00:00:16,235 --> 00:00:18,635
(Raj:)If it's okay with you,
I'd like to go to temple.

7
00:00:18,638 --> 00:00:23,138
(Howard:)Buddy, trust me, you don't want
to convert to Judaism.

8
00:00:24,276 --> 00:00:25,906
(Howard:)I mean, I know I make it
look cool,

9
00:00:25,911 --> 00:00:30,581
(Howard:)but... it's not all briskets
and dreidels.

10
00:00:30,583 --> 00:00:33,153
(Raj:)I meant a Hindu temple.

11
00:00:33,152 --> 00:00:36,152
(Howard:)Oh. Okay.

12
00:00:36,155 --> 00:00:38,655
It's not like Indiana Jones
and the Temple of Doom, right?

13
00:00:38,658 --> 00:00:42,658
(Howard:)Some bald guy with horns
isn't gonna rip my heart out.

14
00:00:42,662 --> 00:00:45,092
(Raj:)Dude, that movie's
an imperialist fantasy

15
00:00:45,097 --> 00:00:48,437
(Raj:)that makes the followers of a
beautiful and peaceful religion

16
00:00:48,434 --> 00:00:50,934
(Raj:)look like a bunch
of bloodthirsty barbarians.

17
00:00:50,936 --> 00:00:51,806
(Howard:)You love that movie.

18
00:00:51,804 --> 00:00:54,374
(Raj:)Yeah, it's pretty great.

19
00:00:57,309 --> 00:01:00,149
(Howard:)I'm surprised to see you
suddenly get religious.

